					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-375038#post-1234651</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-375038/scp-997#post-1234651</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 20 Aug 2011 07:26:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>bogleech</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>425135</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Upvoting, really creative concept, I appreciate the last test a lot and I like that the device is a bizarre &quot;lamp&quot; with no light.</p> <p>However, this is one SCP that would have absolutely zero effect on me. Cockroaches, silverfish and rats are all animals I've kept as pets. I find parasites fascinating and worthy of great respect for their evolutionary impact. The only organism I'm afraid of are ticks, but I still find them too &quot;cool&quot; to probably qualify as verminous to me.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
